# Used by the HermiT check, not by the shapes: one individual typed with two classes the T-Box declares disjoint (mandatory and optional feature).
@prefix o4de: <http://www.zt4swe.io/o4de#> .
@prefix owl: <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#> .
@prefix rdfs: <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#> .
o4de:BothFeature a owl:NamedIndividual, o4de:MandatoryFeature, o4de:OptionalFeature ; rdfs:label "Both mandatory and optional" .
